{"unit_id": "tag:01MK:proof", "translation": "构造一个如上所示的态射（morphism），等同于构造一个在<MATH_0001>上双线性（bilinear）的映射（map）<MATH_0002>，见《模（Modules）》第<REF_0001>节。只需在开集（opens）<MATH_0003>上的截面（sections）上定义它，并使之与限制映射（restriction mappings）相容。在<MATH_0004>上，我们使用在<MATH_0005>上双线性（bilinear）的映射（map）<MATH_0006>，<MATH_0007>。细节略去。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "bilinear", "target_term": "双线性"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "bilinear", "target_term": "双线性"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指图示的待构造对象。"}, {"source_term": "bilinear", "target_term": "双线性", "context": "修饰与图示态射的构造等价的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指与构造所示态射等价的双线性映射。"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "指引用所指向的章名。"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指取截面的开子集。"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "指开集上的层截面。"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "指截面随开集缩小时的限制映射。"}, {"source_term": "bilinear", "target_term": "双线性", "context": "修饰在指定开集上使用的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指在指定开集上使用的双线性映射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01ML:statement", "translation": "一般而言，上文引理<REF_0001>中构造的映射（map）并非同构（isomorphism）。以下是一个例子。设<MATH_0001>为域（field）。设<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>的次数（degree）为<MATH_0004>，且<MATH_0005>、<MATH_0006>、<MATH_0007>。令<MATH_0008>及<MATH_0009>，所用记号见《代数（Algebra）》第<REF_0002>节。则<MATH_0010>。注意，<MATH_0011>。考虑极大（maximal）理想（ideal）<MATH_0012>。不难看出，<MATH_0013>和<MATH_0014>均具有维数（dimension）<MATH_0015>（在<MATH_0016>上）。但<MATH_0017>的维数（dimension）为<MATH_0018>。因此映射（map）<MATH_0019>并非同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指上文引理中构造的映射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指上文引理的映射一般不具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "指例中选取的域。"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数", "context": "指所给分次中元素的次数。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指提供记号约定的章名。"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大", "context": "限定所考察的理想为极大理想。"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "指例中所考察的极大理想。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "指前两个对象在指定域上的维数。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "指用来作比较的第三个对象的维数。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指例中据维数比较进行判断的映射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指在该例的结论中被否定的性质。"}], "notes": []}
