{"unit_id": "tag:01MM:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾《代数（Algebra）》第<REF_0001>节中扭转（twisted）模（module）<MATH_0001>的构造。它与一个分次（graded）模（module）相关联，后者定义在一个分次环（graded ring）上。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "twisted", "target_term": "扭转"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指介绍所回顾构造的章名。"}, {"source_term": "twisted", "target_term": "扭转", "context": "限定引用中由原分次模构造的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指该构造得到的扭转模。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "说明与所得扭转模相关联的原模带有分次。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指由此构造扭转模的分次模。"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "指原分次模所定义于其上的环。"}], "notes": []}
